bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Shop Page (Emoji Pack Shop)" as UI
boundary Router
control EmojiPackController
control EmojiPackService
control UserService
entity ":EmojiPackModel" as EmojiPackModel
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open emoji pack shop
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /emoji-pack/get-pack-for-shop?page&limit
activate Router

Router -> EmojiPackController: 3. getPackForShop(page,limit,req)
activate EmojiPackController

EmojiPackController -> EmojiPackService: 4. getPackForShop(page,limit,payload)
activate EmojiPackService

EmojiPackService -> UserService: 5. checkUser(user_id)
activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 5.1 find user
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 5.2 query user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 5.3 user data
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 5.4 result
deactivate UserModel
UserService --> EmojiPackService: 5.5 valid user
deactivate UserService

EmojiPackService -> UserService: 6. getEmojiPackOwn(user_id)
activate UserService
UserService -> MongoDB: 6.1 query owned packs
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserService: 6.2 owned packs
deactivate MongoDB
UserService --> EmojiPackService: 6.3 return list
deactivate UserService

EmojiPackService -> EmojiPackModel: 7. find packs price > 0
activate EmojiPackModel
EmojiPackModel -> MongoDB: 7.1 query packs (skip,limit,sort,populate)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> EmojiPackModel: 7.2 pack list
deactivate MongoDB
EmojiPackModel --> EmojiPackService: 7.3 packs
deactivate EmojiPackModel

EmojiPackService -> EmojiPackModel: 8. countDocuments(price > 0)
activate EmojiPackModel
EmojiPackModel -> MongoDB: 8.1 count packs
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> EmojiPackModel: 8.2 total
deactivate MongoDB
EmojiPackModel --> EmojiPackService: 8.3 total
deactivate EmojiPackModel

EmojiPackService -> EmojiPackService: 9. Filter owned packs
activate EmojiPackService
space
deactivate EmojiPackService

EmojiPackService --> EmojiPackController: 10. Return packs + pagination
deactivate EmojiPackService

EmojiPackController --> Router: 11. HTTP 200 response
deactivate EmojiPackController

Router --> UI: 12. Shop pack list
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 13. Display packs for purchase

deactivate UI
deactivate User